# Google Sign-In (Google Identity Services)
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID of type "Web application"
# 3. Under "Authorized JavaScript origins" add your domains, e.g.
#      https://fitsmart.space
#      http://localhost:5173   (for local dev)
# 4. Copy the Client ID here (it looks like: 1234567890-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com)
#
# Without this value the login page shows a working demo sign-in instead.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
